<!doctype html>
<html lang="ja"><head>
  <meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>受信ボックスを再開 | トイバコ</title>
  <style>
    :root{color-scheme:light;--navy:#1F3A5F;--coral:#FF6B5B;--paper:#FFFDF9;--surface:#FCFBF8;--ink:#24303F;--line:#E5E3DB;--muted:#596675}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);font:14px/1.7 "Hiragino Sans","Noto Sans JP",sans-serif}
    main{max-width:640px;margin:auto;padding:24px 16px 40px}h1{font-size:22px;color:var(--navy);margin:16px 0 8px}h2{font-size:16px;margin:0;color:var(--navy)}
    p{margin:8px 0}a{color:var(--navy);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px}.note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}.card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;background:var(--paper);margin:20px 0}
    .connection{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;min-height:52px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:12px 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
    input{width:20px;height:20px;accent-color:var(--navy);flex:none}button{font:inherit;font-weight:600;border:0;border-radius:10px;background:var(--navy);color:white;min-height:44px;padding:10px 20px;cursor:pointer}
    button:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:default}a:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #C84435;outline-offset:3px}
    [role=alert]{color:#A12D22}.summary{border-left:3px solid var(--coral);padding-left:14px}[hidden]{display:none!important}
  </style>
</head><body><main>
  <a href="/toybaco/growth/held?account_id=<%= @account.id %>">接続の保留状況へ</a>
  <h1>受信ボックスを再開</h1>
  <p><%= @account.name %></p>
  <p>再開する受信ボックスを選んでください。</p>
  <form id="inbox-release-form">
    <section class="card" aria-labelledby="inboxes-title">
      <h2 id="inboxes-title">受信ボックス</h2>
      <p class="note">今のプランは合計<%= @state.fetch('limit') %>件まで利用できます。</p>
      <% @state.fetch('inboxes').each do |row| %>
        <label class="connection">
          <input type="checkbox" name="inbox_ids" value="<%= row.fetch('id') %>" <%= 'checked disabled' unless row.fetch('held') %>>
          <span><%= row.fetch('name') %><small class="note" data-inbox-state="<%= row.fetch('id') %>"><%= row.fetch('held') ? ' · 保留中' : ' · 契約による保留なし' %></small></span>
        </label>
      <% end %>
    </section>
    <p class="note">選んだ窓口の受信・返信を再開します。投稿の保留や予約は変わりません。</p>
    <p id="inbox-release-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
    <p id="inbox-release-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1"></p>
    <button id="inbox-release-submit" type="submit">選んだ受信ボックスを再開</button>
    <p><a id="inbox-release-refresh" href="/toybaco/growth/inbox-release?account_id=<%= @account.id %>" hidden>最新の状態に更新</a></p>
  </form>
  <script id="inbox-release-state" type="application/json"><%= raw(json_escape(@state.merge('account_id' => @account.id).to_json)) %></script>
  <script type="module" src="/toybaco-growth-inbox-release.mjs?v=<%= Digest::SHA256.file(Rails.public_path.join('toybaco-growth-inbox-release.mjs')).hexdigest %>"></script>
</main></body></html>
